<h2 id="range">CIE Hand-Driven Models</h2>

<p>
  CIE makes hand-driven testers in a metal body (CIE/444), a wooden body (CIE/666) and a compact bakelite body (CIE/555), with single-range and multirange versions, all conforming to IS 2992. For sustained testing, the motor-driven CIE/777 range holds the voltage as long as you need. Browse <a href={u('/products/insulation-testers-hand/')}>hand-driven insulation testers</a>, <a href={u('/products/multirange-insulation-hand/')}>multirange models</a> and <a href={u('/products/motor-operated-insulation/')}>motor-operated testers</a>, and read <a href={u('/blog/multirange-insulation-testers-explained/')}>multirange insulation testers explained</a>.
</p>

<p>
  Not sure which to choose? <a href={u('/contact/')}>Ask CIE</a>.
</p>
